---
layout: base.njk
fieldPhotosPublic: true
permalink: /recommendations/
title: Location Brief | Rofo
description: Review a personalized commercial Location Brief with recommended starting areas, evidence, tradeoffs, representative buildings, validation questions, and next steps.
eleventyComputed:
  canonical: "{{ metadata.siteUrl }}/recommendations/"
---

<section class="recommendations-page location-brief-page">
  <div class="recommendations-shell location-brief-page__shell">
    <div class="breadcrumbs">
      <a href="/">Rofo</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span>Location Brief</span>
    </div>

    <section class="location-brief-profile" aria-labelledby="location-brief-profile-heading">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Business Profile</div>
        <h1 id="location-brief-profile-heading">Business Profile</h1>
        <p data-location-brief-profile-intro>These are the business characteristics that shaped this Location Brief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="location-brief-profile__chips" data-location-brief-profile-chips>
        <span>San Francisco</span>
        <span>Office</span>
      </div>
      <a class="location-brief-edit-profile" href="/find-locations/">Edit Business Profile</a>
    </section>

    <section class="location-brief-summary" aria-labelledby="location-brief-summary-heading">
      <div class="kicker">Executive Summary</div>
      <h2 id="location-brief-summary-heading">Where Rofo would begin.</h2>
      <div class="location-brief-summary__copy">
        <p data-location-brief-summary-copy-one>
          Based on your Business Profile, Mission Bay, SoMa, and South Beach are the strongest places to begin your search.
        </p>
        <p data-location-brief-summary-copy-two>
          These locations create a practical starting point before reviewing live availability, lease economics, or individual buildings with a broker.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="location-brief-best-fits" aria-labelledby="location-brief-best-fits-heading" data-location-brief-best-fits-section>
      <div class="location-brief-section-header">
        <div class="kicker">Best Fits</div>
        <h2 id="location-brief-best-fits-heading">Best Fits</h2>
        <p>These are the districts Rofo would begin with from the current Business Profile.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="location-brief-best-fit-grid" data-location-brief-best-fits></div>
    </section>

    <section class="location-brief-district-detail" aria-labelledby="location-brief-district-detail-heading" data-location-brief-district-detail>
      <div class="location-brief-section-header">
        <div class="kicker">District Detail</div>
        <h2 id="location-brief-district-detail-heading">Why these places fit.</h2>
        <p>Use the district detail to understand the character of each recommended starting point.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="location-brief-district-detail__grid" data-location-brief-district-detail-grid></div>
    </section>

    <section class="location-brief-comparative-guidance" aria-labelledby="location-brief-comparative-heading">
      <div class="kicker">Comparative Guidance</div>
      <h2 id="location-brief-comparative-heading">How to use this recommendation.</h2>
      <p data-location-brief-comparative-copy>
        Use the Best Fits to decide which district character to validate first. Current availability, rents, and building-level fit still need market review.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="location-brief-representative-buildings" aria-labelledby="location-brief-buildings-heading" data-location-brief-representative-buildings>
      <div class="location-brief-section-header">
        <div class="kicker">Representative Buildings</div>
        <h2 id="location-brief-buildings-heading">Representative buildings to understand the district character.</h2>
        <p>These are representative examples, not current availability. They help explain the kinds of commercial environments to evaluate next.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="location-brief-building-groups" data-location-brief-building-groups></div>
    </section>

    <section class="location-brief-refinement" aria-labelledby="location-brief-refinement-heading" data-location-brief-refinement>
      <div class="location-brief-refinement__intro">
        <div class="kicker">Questions to Validate</div>
        <h2 id="location-brief-refinement-heading">What to confirm before touring.</h2>
        <p>Use these questions to turn the recommendation into a focused live market review.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="location-brief-refinement__grid">
        <section class="location-brief-refinement__panel" aria-labelledby="brief-priorities-heading">
          <h3 id="brief-priorities-heading">What should be checked first?</h3>
          <p>Choose the building and market issues that matter most before touring.</p>
          <div class="location-brief-priority-list" data-location-brief-priorities></div>
        </section>

        <section class="location-brief-refinement__panel" aria-labelledby="brief-questions-heading">
          <h3 id="brief-questions-heading">Questions to validate next</h3>
          <ul class="location-brief-question-list" data-location-brief-questions>
            <li>Current availability in the recommended districts.</li>
            <li>Lease economics and timing for specific buildings.</li>
            <li>Comparable buildings and nearby alternatives.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="location-brief-refinement__panel" aria-labelledby="brief-notes-heading">
          <h3 id="brief-notes-heading">Additional notes</h3>
          <label class="location-brief-notes-label" for="location-brief-notes">Optional notes</label>
          <textarea id="location-brief-notes" data-location-brief-notes rows="4" placeholder="Example: parking is critical, clients visit weekly, or we need room to expand."></textarea>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <form class="recommendations-cta location-brief-contact location-brief-contact--final" id="location-brief-contact" data-location-brief-contact aria-labelledby="market-investigation" method="post" action="/api/location-brief/submit">
      <div class="location-brief-contact__header">
        <div class="kicker" data-recommendation-cta-kicker>Next Steps</div>
        <h2 id="market-investigation" data-recommendation-cta-heading>Request Current Availability.</h2>
        <p data-recommendation-cta-copy>
          Send this Location Brief to Rofo for review. We will check the request and determine the best next step.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="recommendations-cta__panel">
        <h3>What a broker can validate</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Current availability</li>
          <li>Specific buildings to tour</li>
          <li>Asking rents and concessions</li>
          <li>Lease structure and timing</li>
          <li>Comparable options</li>
          <li>Market conditions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <section class="live-market-intake" aria-labelledby="live-market-intake-heading" data-live-market-investigation-intake hidden>
        <div class="live-market-intake__header">
          <div class="kicker">Current Availability Request</div>
          <h3 id="live-market-intake-heading" data-live-market-intake-heading>Confirm what Rofo should check next</h3>
          <p data-live-market-intake-summary>These details help fulfillment review current availability, comparable buildings, timing, and market context.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="live-market-intake__context" aria-label="Recommendation context">
          <dl>
            <div>
              <dt>Recommended city</dt>
              <dd data-live-market-intake-city>To confirm</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>District</dt>
              <dd data-live-market-intake-district>To confirm</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Business Profile</dt>
              <dd data-live-market-intake-profile>Profile details preserved</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="live-market-intake__fieldset" data-live-market-building-fieldset>
          <legend>Buildings to include</legend>
          <p>Keep the representative buildings Rofo should use as reference points. You can still ask Rofo to investigate the district even if no individual building remains selected.</p>
          <div class="live-market-building-options" data-live-market-building-options></div>
          <label class="live-market-check">
            <input type="checkbox" data-investigation-competitive-buildings checked>
            <span>Include other competitive buildings in this district</span>
          </label>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="live-market-intake__fieldset">
          <legend>What should Rofo check?</legend>
          <p>Select only what matters for the next review.</p>
          <div class="live-market-scope-grid" data-live-market-scope-options>
            <label class="live-market-check"><input type="checkbox" value="currentAvailability" checked> <span>Current availability</span></label>
            <label class="live-market-check"><input type="checkbox" value="futureAvailability" checked> <span>Future or upcoming availability</span></label>
            <label class="live-market-check"><input type="checkbox" value="comparableBuildings" checked> <span>Comparable buildings</span></label>
            <label class="live-market-check"><input type="checkbox" value="leasingActivity"> <span>Recent leasing activity or comps</span></label>
            <label class="live-market-check"><input type="checkbox" value="marketInsight"> <span>Market conditions and tenant considerations</span></label>
            <label class="live-market-check"><input type="checkbox" value="brokerGuidance"> <span>Broker guidance when available</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="live-market-intake__grid">
          <section class="live-market-intake__fieldset" aria-labelledby="live-market-requirements-heading">
            <h4 id="live-market-requirements-heading">Execution details</h4>
            <dl class="live-market-requirements" data-live-market-requirements></dl>
            <label class="live-market-field">
              <span>Headcount <em>optional</em></span>
              <input type="text" data-live-market-headcount placeholder="Example: 18 people">
            </label>
            <label class="live-market-field">
              <span>Approximate size <em>optional</em></span>
              <input type="text" data-live-market-size placeholder="Example: 3,000-5,000 sq ft">
            </label>
            <label class="live-market-field">
              <span>Timing</span>
              <select data-live-market-timing>
                <option value="">Use profile timing if available</option>
                <option value="immediately">Immediately</option>
                <option value="within_3_months">Within 3 months</option>
                <option value="3_6_months">3-6 months</option>
                <option value="6_12_months">6-12 months</option>
                <option value="more_than_12_months">More than 12 months</option>
                <option value="exploring">Exploring with no fixed date</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label class="live-market-field">
              <span>Budget or rent context <em>optional</em></span>
              <input type="text" data-live-market-budget placeholder="Preserved for review; not used to rank districts">
            </label>
          </section>

          <fieldset class="live-market-intake__fieldset">
            <legend>How should Rofo follow up?</legend>
            <div class="live-market-radio-list" data-live-market-broker-preference>
              <label class="live-market-check"><input type="radio" name="broker_preference" value="research_first" checked> <span>Research first; contact me with findings</span></label>
              <label class="live-market-check"><input type="radio" name="broker_preference" value="include_local_broker"> <span>Include local broker guidance when available</span></label>
              <label class="live-market-check"><input type="radio" name="broker_preference" value="already_working_with_broker"> <span>I am already working with a broker</span></label>
              <label class="live-market-check"><input type="radio" name="broker_preference" value="not_sure"> <span>Not sure yet</span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </div>

        <label class="live-market-field live-market-field--notes">
          <span>Anything else Rofo should understand before investigating? <em>optional</em></span>
          <textarea data-live-market-notes rows="4" placeholder="Examples: exact streets, parking needs, expansion plans, current lease timing, infrastructure requirements, or building types to avoid."></textarea>
        </label>
      </section>

      <div class="location-brief-contact__grid">
        <label>
          <span>Name</span>
          <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>Email</span>
          <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>Company <em>optional</em></span>
          <input type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization">
        </label>
        <label>
          <span>Phone <em>optional</em></span>
          <input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel">
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="location-brief-contact__actions">
        <button class="recommendations-button" type="submit" data-location-brief-submit-button>Request Current Availability</button>
        <p data-location-brief-contact-status></p>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<script id="location-knowledge-graph-data" type="application/json">{{ locationKnowledgeGraph | dump | safe }}</script>
<script id="recommendation-profiles-data" type="application/json">{{ recommendationProfiles | dump | safe }}</script>
<script id="recommendation-representative-buildings-data" type="application/json">{{ recommendationRepresentativeBuildings | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/js/recommendation-resolver.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/recommendation-representative-buildings.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/recommendation-context.js" defer></script>
